WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.506
Dr. Jemison [sic], he gave us some guns,

2
00:00:02.506 --> 00:00:08.220
told us to guard the house while he went to the stadium and got things straight about the money [donations].

3
00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:09.980
So we stayed there.

4
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:14.260
Two policemen came by in a car and they saw us with the guns.

5
00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:15.920
I had the gun cocked on him.

6
00:00:15.920 --> 00:00:17.500
He told me to lower it.

7
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:18.580
I didn’t hear him say that!

8
00:00:18.580 --> 00:00:22.500
Well, the policeman said, “I’ll have to take you uptown.”

9
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:27.160
So I went up there with him . . . We was out there to shoot or be shot, too.
